  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added a static FromAnyJson(..)-method to ParameterCollection, which try to convert any inputted json to a ParameterCollection.\n        - Added a ToSimpleType(..)-method to ParameterCollection, which converts the given ParameterCollection to a simpler json as key-value-pairs. All other data is ignored.\n        - Added a new JTokenParameterConverter to convert JToken. This is not added to the default converters and need to be added as a customConverter to use.\n        - Added a new DictionaryParameterConverter to convert generic Dictionaries and other who implement generic IDictionary. This is not added to the default converters and need to be added as a customConverter to use.",
